msgstr "Remove all plugin data (settings and key pair) on uninstall"

#: admin-templates/partials/settings-form.php:123
msgid "Deactivating the plugin never removes data. Deleting the plugin removes data only if this box is ticked. Leave unticked to preserve settings + key across reinstalls."
msgstr "Deactivating the plugin never removes data. Deleting the plugin removes data only if this box is ticked. Leave unticked to preserve settings + key across reinstalls."

